  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kwithu Kitchen Tomato Value Addition Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kwithu Kitchen is an agro-processing project that will benefit 516 farmers (266 female) by providing intensive training on growing ideal tomato for freshly jarred tomatoes. The project will also provide intensive marketing and business training for the project staff to improve sales of their unique product.</narrative>
  </description>
